goodnight_1#:#It is already after 8 pm. The noodles are resting – take a break, too. We will continue tomorrow.
goodnight_2#:#The Kodama is already asleep deep in the forest. Whatever remained unanswered today will happily wait until tomorrow.
goodnight_3#:#Even udon senseis need sleep. Sleep well – the forum keeps the broth warm.
goodnight_4#:#The Tanuki has turned into a pillow. Time to close the screen.
goodnight_close#:#Hide for tonight
